  "thumbnailUrl": "https://gdb.voanews.com/ee3e6fb5-9ea6-4f8b-88b4-c24e14fb2780_tv_w1080_h608.jpg",
  "language": "en",
  "translationLanguage": "ko",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Today, Pete and I are meeting with a consultant who will help us with our new show.",
      "startMs": 7440,
      "endMs": 12760
    },
    {
      "text": "Yesterday, Pete had promised to meet me here at 8 a .m.",
      "startMs": 13440,
      "endMs": 18140
    },
    {
      "text": "But he did not come on time.",
      "startMs": 18560,
      "endMs": 22220
    },
    {
      "text": "Uh -oh.",
      "startMs": 23710,
      "endMs": 24550
    },
    {
      "text": "It's bad to be late for a business meeting.",
      "startMs": 24870,
      "endMs": 27710
    },
    {
      "text": "But while we wait for Pete, let's talk about a new verb tense, past perfect.",
      "startMs": 27970,
      "endMs": 33650
    },
    {
      "text": "You know the past tense, right?",
      "startMs": 34090,
      "endMs": 35890
    },
    {
      "text": "Like.",
      "startMs": 36350,
      "endMs": 36670
    },
    {
      "text": "Pete promised to meet me here at 8 a .m.",
      "startMs": 36670,
      "endMs": 40550
    },
    {
      "text": "Past perfect is a little different.",
      "startMs": 41650,
      "endMs": 44090
    },
    {
      "text": "When we talk about two things in the past, we can use the past perfect for the first event.",
      "startMs": 44470,
      "endMs": 51250
    },
    {
      "text": "Put had before the past participle.",
      "startMs": 51750,
      "endMs": 54350
    },
    {
      "text": "Pete had promised he would meet Anna.",
      "startMs": 55090,
      "endMs": 57790
    },
    {
      "text": "Here's your assignment.",
      "startMs": 58030,
      "endMs": 59410
    },
    {
      "text": "Find sentences with the past perfect tense.",
      "startMs": 59770,
      "endMs": 63630
    },
    {
      "text": "Remember before had.",
      "startMs": 63990,
      "endMs": 66310
    },
    {
      "text": "You two are late.",
      "startMs": 66310,
      "endMs": 71170
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly 43 minutes late.",
      "startMs": 72500,
      "endMs": 74860
    },
    {
      "text": "What happened?",
      "startMs": 75630,
      "endMs": 76770
    },
    {
      "text": "He had to get his special coffee.",
      "startMs": 77590,
      "endMs": 80250
    },
    {
      "text": "Special coffee.",
      "startMs": 80810,
      "endMs": 81950
    },
    {
      "text": "She had to feed her birds.",
      "startMs": 83120,
      "endMs": 85540
    },
    {
      "text": "Her birds?",
      "startMs": 86220,
      "endMs": 87340
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course I have to feed the birds.",
      "startMs": 87880,
      "endMs": 89540
    },
    {
      "text": "Who's going to feed them?",
      "startMs": 89900,
      "endMs": 90280
    },
    {
      "text": "It's very special coffee.",
      "startMs": 90280,
      "endMs": 91240
    },
    {
      "text": "You don't have any cases.",
      "startMs": 91460,
      "endMs": 92740
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "startMs": 93080,
      "endMs": 93080
    },
    {
      "text": "I can see already that you two need my help.",
      "startMs": 93800,
      "endMs": 96040
    },
    {
      "text": "You can't both talk at the same time.",
      "startMs": 96040,
      "endMs": 98620
    },
    {
      "text": "You have to take turns.",
      "startMs": 99000,
      "endMs": 100080
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, Anna, you go first.",
      "startMs": 101080,
      "endMs": 102420
    },
    {
      "text": "Sure.",
      "startMs": 103040,
      "endMs": 103440
    },
    {
      "text": "Kelly, see Pete and I live in the same building.",
      "startMs": 104720,
      "endMs": 107960
    },
    {
      "text": "So we decided to meet at 8 a .m.",
      "startMs": 108340,
      "endMs": 111560
    },
    {
      "text": "8 a .m.",
      "startMs": 112100,
      "endMs": 113060
    },
    {
      "text": "to come to work together.",
      "startMs": 113140,
      "endMs": 114740
    },
    {
      "text": "I had waited 15 minutes when Pete arrived.",
      "startMs": 116510,
      "endMs": 121070
    },
    {
      "text": "After Pete had wasted time waiting for coffee, we were late.",
      "startMs": 121070,
      "endMs": 132010
    },
    {
      "text": "I left you a message.",
      "startMs": 133540,
      "endMs": 134720
    },
    {
      "text": "I didn't get that message.",
      "startMs": 135380,
      "endMs": 137800
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, sorry.",
      "startMs": 138620,
      "endMs": 139940
    },
    {
      "text": "Pete?",
      "startMs": 141140,
      "endMs": 141460
    },
    {
      "text": "Anna left a message.",
      "startMs": 142280,
      "endMs": 144300
    },
    {
      "text": "That's the right thing to do.",
      "startMs": 144680,
      "endMs": 146700
    },
    {
      "text": "Did you find some examples of the past perfect tense?",
      "startMs": 147060,
      "endMs": 151000
    },
    {
      "text": "I did.",
      "startMs": 151500,
      "endMs": 151860
    },
    {
      "text": "Anna said.",
      "startMs": 151860,
      "endMs": 152900
    },
    {
      "text": "After Pete had wasted time waiting for coffee, we were late.",
      "startMs": 153320,
      "endMs": 157940
    },
    {
      "text": "Look at that coffee.",
      "startMs": 158500,
      "endMs": 159860
    },
    {
      "text": "It looks more like dessert.",
      "startMs": 160180,
      "endMs": 161860
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "startMs": 162260,
      "endMs": 162820
    },
    {
      "text": "Deep watching for past perfect.",
      "startMs": 163340,
      "endMs": 165940
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "startMs": 168410,
      "endMs": 169050
    },
    {
      "text": "That's not why we're late.",
      "startMs": 169710,
      "endMs": 170970
    },
    {
      "text": "This is why we're late.",
      "startMs": 171600,
      "endMs": 172940
    },
    {
      "text": "I had arrived on time at 8 a .m.",
      "startMs": 173720,
      "endMs": 177020
    },
    {
      "text": "but didn't see Anna.",
      "startMs": 177040,
      "endMs": 178440
    },
    {
      "text": "She was standing behind a tree.",
      "startMs": 178780,
      "endMs": 180740
    },
    {
      "text": "I think she was hugging it.",
      "startMs": 180920,
      "endMs": 182240
    },
    {
      "text": "I always walk to work.",
      "startMs": 182240,
      "endMs": 184380
    },
    {
      "text": "But she said that would take too long and that a scooter would be faster.",
      "startMs": 184640,
      "endMs": 190600
    },
    {
      "text": "It was awful.",
      "startMs": 191020,
      "endMs": 192620
    },
    {
      "text": "I hated it.",
      "startMs": 192940,
      "endMs": 193720
    },
    {
      "text": "And it added too much time to our commute.",
      "startMs": 193840,
      "endMs": 197760
    },
    {
      "text": "Then Anna stopped by a pond to feed the birds.",
      "startMs": 198240,
      "endMs": 203100
    },
    {
      "text": "She had named them after characters from books and yelled the names out loud.",
      "startMs": 203540,
      "endMs": 210180
    },
    {
      "text": "Romeo, Juliet, Sherlock.",
      "startMs": 210180,
      "endMs": 214400
    },
    {
      "text": "By the time she had fed all the birds, we were late.",
      "startMs": 215950,
      "endMs": 220580
    },
    {
      "text": "This is what I think.",
      "startMs": 220820,
      "endMs": 221880
    },
    {
      "text": "You two see the same event very differently.",
      "startMs": 223070,
      "endMs": 227090
    },
    {
      "text": "Does this happen often with you two?",
      "startMs": 227810,
      "endMs": 229610
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "startMs": 230310,
      "endMs": 230610
    },
    {
      "text": "No.",
      "startMs": 230610,
      "endMs": 230930
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "startMs": 231920,
      "endMs": 232380
    },
    {
      "text": "What are you talking about?",
      "startMs": 233730,
      "endMs": 234950
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "startMs": 235050,
      "endMs": 235430
    },
    {
      "text": "This is good.",
      "startMs": 235730,
      "endMs": 236570
    },
    {
      "text": "This is good.",
      "startMs": 236770,
      "endMs": 237470
    },
    {
      "text": "It's good to see things differently.",
      "startMs": 237850,
      "endMs": 239610
    },
    {
      "text": "I have an idea.",
      "startMs": 239610,
      "endMs": 242200
    },
    {
      "text": "We will call the show He Said, She Said.",
      "startMs": 243200,
      "endMs": 247100
    },
    {
      "text": "For every story, you tell a different point of view.",
      "startMs": 248590,
      "endMs": 251670
    },
    {
      "text": "That is a great idea, Kelly.",
      "startMs": 252310,
      "endMs": 254150
    },
    {
      "text": "Pete, we are different.",
      "startMs": 254890,
      "endMs": 257410
    },
    {
      "text": "That's why I thought of you for this job.",
      "startMs": 257930,
      "endMs": 260290
    },
    {
      "text": "I think you two understand perfectly.",
      "startMs": 260710,
      "endMs": 262650
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's get to work.",
      "startMs": 265000,
      "endMs": 266080
    },
    {
      "text": "She named the birds.",
      "startMs": 270910,
      "endMs": 271750
    },
    {
      "text": "Really?",
      "startMs": 272270,
      "endMs": 272590
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course, Anna named the birds.",
      "startMs": 272590,
      "endMs": 278540
    },
    {
      "text": "Everyone should have a name, and everyone should learn past perfect.",
      "startMs": 278860,
      "endMs": 283900
    },
    {
      "text": "Remember, you can use it to talk about two different things that happened in the past.",
      "startMs": 284300,
      "endMs": 290720
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, Professor Bott signing off.",
      "startMs": 291540,
      "endMs": 295560
    }
  ]
}